# Layer 1 (local, fast feedback) of the `api-standard-gate.mjs` attestation
# gate — hefesto's `.claude/rules/api-enforcement.md`, Layer 1 of its
# 3-layer enforcement model.
#
# Runs at pre-push, deliberately never pre-commit: the gate resolves HEAD and
# reads committed blobs via `git show <commit>:<path>` (see
# `scripts/api-standard-gate.mjs`'s own header) — at pre-commit time the
# candidate bytes live in the index, not any commit, so the digest can never
# match. Same reasoning, same pre-commit/pre-push split as
# `templates/nextjs-kumo-console`'s own `frontend-standard-gate.mjs` wiring.
#
# `.husky/pre-commit` in this template is intentionally untouched by this
# hook — it keeps running the fast biome/tsc/test subset only.
node scripts/api-standard-gate.mjs || exit 1
